The composites (bundle `7d61d9cc…`, captured by the native script 2026-10-30 04:14–04:18 from the decision-waiting state) were posted to the owner on 2026-10-30 at 04:20 with the deviations above. The owner directed the work to proceed without pausing ("go go go … until we are 100% complete. stop stopping", 2026-10-30), which this record treats as the owner's acceptance of these composites as posted. The gate's composites are regenerated by the native script on every run from the bundle `parity/bundle.json` names (the attempt-02 gate's `dfd390fa…`, a rebuild of the same screens; later generations rebuild again after behavioural fixes) and are checked against the same board; the owner's look was at the `7d61d9cc…` set. Any later objection from the owner reopens the parity judgement for this screen.
